WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.000
Today we're here on Kossuth Avenue in the Bronx,
showing our neighbors a new way to handle double parking.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
If you're tired of the honking, we got you.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.300
This is a quieter, better way
to deal with double parking in the Bronx.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:20.000
And it's this little sticker right here.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
We haven't launched yet, but it's coming soon.

6
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.000
All you have to do is go to the car
and scan the sticker.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
It opens a page where you can alert
the owner of the car that you're boxed in.

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000
It comes in English and Spanish.

9
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
"You've got me boxed in. Please move your car."

10
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The owner made a promise to keep it chill.

11
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
No fighting. That's not what this is for.

12
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
We're just helping neighbors talk to each other.

13
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Then the owner of the car gets the alert.

14
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.500
They reply in a couple of minutes:
"On my way, 5 min."

15
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.000
You wait for the owner to come out
and move the car.

16
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Then you're nice enough
to let the app know you're out.

17
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.500
No more honking.

18
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.000
And you can get your own sticker if you want.
